; ApolloUpdate lookup table -- SYS:System/ApolloUpdate
; Default for AmigaOS (3.1 - 3.2.x) on the Apollo V4: the release of every
; Name that a standard installation has. ApolloUpdate writes this file when
; SYS:System/ApolloUpdate is missing on AmigaOS.
; One entry per line: Category/Name/Version
; Category, Name and Version are the Level-1/2/3 folder names in the
; ApolloSoftware repo. Lines starting with ";" are comments.
; Leave the Version empty for a Name that is not installed.

